  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3110.03 Violations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3110.03 Violations. The director shall issue a notice of violation and an order of abatement, which may be appealed in accordance with Env-A 200, establishing a compliance schedule with which the user source shall comply whenever the director finds that enforcement against the user source for non-compliance is warranted.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
